From: Mauro Ribeiro <mauro.ribeiro@hardkernel.com>
Subject: [PATCH] media: meson: vdec: set STATUS_NEEDS_RESUME on source change

Signed-off-by: Mauro Ribeiro <mauro.ribeiro@hardkernel.com>
---
 drivers/staging/media/meson/vdec/vdec_helpers.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/drivers/staging/media/meson/vdec/vdec_helpers.c b/drivers/staging/media/meson/vdec/vdec_helpers.c
--- a/drivers/staging/media/meson/vdec/vdec_helpers.c
+++ b/drivers/staging/media/meson/vdec/vdec_helpers.c
@@ -498,6 +498,7 @@ void amvdec_src_change(struct amvdec_session *sess, u32 width,

 	sess->width = width;
 	sess->height = height;
+	sess->status = STATUS_NEEDS_RESUME;

 	dev_dbg(sess->core->dev, "Res. changed (%ux%u), DPB %u, bitdepth %u\n",
 		width, height, dpb_size, bitdepth);
